SUMMARY:Puppy Kindergarten (Lea Pfeiffer)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261201T000000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261201T005500Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261115T010022Z
UID:1796083200_PuppyKindergarten@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:If you recently added a new puppy to your family\, you're in t
 he right place! Puppy Kindergarten is the perfect place to start for puppi
 es between the age of 2 and 5 months. We'll cover everything from teaching
  your puppy his name to the manners he'll need to be a great member of you
 r household. We'll also address unwanted behaviors like chewing\, jumping\
 , and pulling on the leash. Last but not least\, we'll help you socialize 
 your puppy to strange noises\, objects\, and surfaces!
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NW3 -  Novice Nosework (Melinda Meche)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261201T000000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261201T010000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261115T010022Z
UID:1796083200_NW3-NoviceNosework@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:In the Novice class of Nosework we add all of the oils into ou
 r cocktail so that your dog can start to discriminate between the differen
 t oils. We will start to build our search areas to mock Novice trial-like 
 settings. We will start to discuss rules and regulations of AKC\, UKC and 
 other organizations.
END:VEVENT
