UID:1796091300_Agility-Pre-Novice@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:The Pre-Novice class is for teams who are gearing up to compet
 e! It focuses on closing weaves\, nailing contacts\, and adding to sequenc
 es
END:VEVENT
