BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Manners 1 - Basic (Rachel Simmons)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261212T151500Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261212T161000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261115T010037Z
UID:1797088500_Manners1-Basic@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Let’s face it\, dogs these days are part of the family. But 
 as much as we treat them like furry humans\, they need some help to act li
 ke it! In Basic Manners\, we cover the essentials that your dog needs to b
 e a well-behaved member of your family. You’ll learn things like not jum
 ping up\, coming when called\, and walking nicely on a leash\, as well as 
 your standard sit\, down\, and stay! We also work on impulse control\, the
  “place” behavior\, and sitting at the door\, all of which discourage 
 naughty behavior like stealing food\, darting out the door\, and begging/c
 ounter surfing.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Specialty - Zen Dog (Rachel Simmons)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261212T163000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261212T172500Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261115T010037Z
UID:1797093000_Specialty-ZenDog@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Does your dog have a hard time settling down in arousing situa
 tions\, such as when company is over or on restaurant patios? Do they get 
 nervous or display demand behaviors like barking\, whining\, or more when 
 you aren’t paying attention to them? If your dog is over-excited in new 
 situations or too nervous to calm down\, Zen Dog is the class for you! Fou
 r-weeks long\, this class will focus on teaching us how to nurture our dog
 s’ ability to self-soothe and settle in the home as well as in novel env
 ironments by incorporating impulse control\, the “art of doing nothing
 ” and more. These life-long skills can help set you and your dog up for 
 success at home or in public\, and are a great foundation for creating a h
 ealthier and more enjoyable relationship between you and your dog.\nIf thi
 s is your first class at Lucky Dog\, please attend an orientation before e
 nrolling.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Orientation (Rachel Simmons)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261212T180000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261212T183000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261115T010037Z
UID:1797098400_Orientation@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Orientation is a mini-class to cover requirements and check th
 at your dog will be a good fit for Basic Manners. Our manners classes typi
 cally fill 1-3 weeks before they start\, so you may want to register for c
 lass in advance!\nAfter reserving your spot\, you'll receive a confirmatio
 n email with instructions for orientation. Please be sure you're opted in 
 for reminder emails and we look forward to seeing you soon!
END:VEVENT
